{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203400","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203400","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1320340001:1":{"text":"啧，你们这群多管闲事的家伙怎么还在？！","source_cn":"啧，你们这群多管闲事的家伙怎么还在？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1728B2E54513BCFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320340002:1":{"text":"——又是你！上次来的时候，你不是答应我们多宽限一段时间吗？！","source_cn":"——又是你！上次来的时候，你不是答应我们多宽限一段时间吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E35CDE3B134D6BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320340003:1":{"text":"是，我是答应了，但我可没说到底要宽限多久。","source_cn":"是，我是答应了，但我可没说到底要宽限多久。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6599ED099F85043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320340004:1":{"text":"现在列夫斯基死了，谁知道老叶甫根尼要拖到什么时候才肯还债！","source_cn":"现在列夫斯基死了，谁知道老叶甫根尼要拖到什么时候才肯还债！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF1F474C94E7C6DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320340005:1":{"text":"我、我不会再拖了！我明天就去找份活计挣钱——","source_cn":"我、我不会再拖了！我明天就去找份活计挣钱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F110DE0CBEEBEE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"